{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《今個夏天食平D》中，肥媽以香濃的羅勒松子醬搭配龍脷柳一同烘烤，製作出風味層次豐富的牛油焗龍脷柳。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"0732ffc2-e4c5-4502-ba3b-a610bb195b47.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026ML7s3Ep7JK1788257376.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"0732ffc2-e4c5-4502-ba3b-a610bb195b47.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">龍脷柳</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">松子</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">蒜頭</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">羅勒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">橄欖油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">巴馬臣芝士</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">番茄</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">牛油</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">法邊豆</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">水滾後，先將法邊豆放入汆水，備用。</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"becad71b-d3f2-4c2d-83f3-4c8a4a20561e.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UhJQS0vcdd1788257372.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"becad71b-d3f2-4c2d-83f3-4c8a4a20561e.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T11:18:40.448432+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}